  "id": "strawberry-avocado-salad",
  "name": "Strawberry Avocado Salad",
  "subtitle": "Fresh fruit salad with honey-cider dressing",
  "description": "Tender greens, creamy avocado, strawberries, and pecans are tossed with a sweet-tart dressing and chilled before serving.",
